  {
    "description": "Start a Feature or Debug pipeline from the user's words. Pass the user's phrasing in utterance (e.g. 'plan with claude, implement with codex, review with agy /swarm'); bindings use shorthand '<agent>[:<model>][@<effort>][ /<native>]'. The human must confirm before anything runs.",
